==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Arctibax|59}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
**Both cards feature the '''Frost Smash''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Crimson Invasion|Regice|28}} from the {{TCG|Crimson Invasion}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

